-    Audit that the active V610 YAML and design document describe the same 14
-    tasks in the same order. Validate structured gates, producer fields, model
-    contracts, prior-failure entries, retired scopes, ARC solve rules, prompt
-    endings, and bounded execution. Report every defect without creating a
