-    4. Require CONTEXT, EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST, TASK, CONCRETE STEPS, one
-       run command, and both final prohibitions in every task prompt.
-    5. Require every LLM task to name at least one mandated SOTA GGUF. Reject
