-    n_ctx=98304 path and emitted a complete 170-line engine. The engine appears
-    to copy shown delta rows, but it has no rigorous held-out score. This task
-    audits the frozen live artifact. It does not generate a replacement engine
-    and does not claim a game or level solve.
-
-    Work at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.
-
-    EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-    - {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md
-    - {project_root}/ops/status.md sections for the 2026-09-04 post-refit run
-    - {project_root}/scripts/arc_e3_induced_model_quality.py
-    - {project_root}/scripts/arc_induction_quality.py
-    - {project_root}/python/carnot/agentic/arc_executable_world_model.py
-    - {project_root}/results/arc_e3/r11l/attempts/
-    - {project_root}/ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml
